Every morning, regional hubs submit shipment records that are used by operations teams to monitor deliveries across the network.

Today's incoming file contains valid records, but it also includes missing destination details, incomplete delivery statuses, invalid package weights, inconsistent hub formatting, and a duplicate shipment.

